每<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 2042000,param11,1)></style>秒，对半径<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(getConfigData,rogue_buff_extend, 204200002,param0)></style>米内目标造成<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 2042000,param5,1,%d)>%</style>双防的真实伤害，并施加<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 2042000,param14,1)></style>层「炽热」，最多<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 20420010,param1,1)></style>层，持续<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(buffConfigData,20420010,duration)></style>秒。「炽热」满层或目标被击败时会爆炸，对周围目标<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 20420011,param4,1,%d)>%</style>双防的真实伤害，并施加<style=Hint_BgL><customRichText(calcData,buff, 20420011,param5,1)></style>层「炽热」。家园空间内可以放置<style=Hint_BgL>14</style>只伊莫
